*key = 119
*value = "This morning, father gave me this journal.\nIt's a gift to mark this special day,\nthe day he was appointed Guardian of Astara.\nFather has trained for years so his\nwisdom and strength will nurture peace as we\nseek greater discoveries and understanding."
*key = 120
*value = "Mother is so proud of him.\nNow, our greatest scientists are\npreparing a marvelous travel system.\nI'm told it will open a giant hole in space,\nso we can visit other worlds."
*key = 121
*value = "I'm so scared; I can hardly hold the pen steady.\nWe had a big celebration and then\nopened the rift, but on the other side evil\ncreatures were waiting to attack.\nA war has started.\nFather went to fight these demons\nthat call themselves Shadowraiths."
*key = 122
*value = "I saw one wraith named Yabu kill\nmy mother and my sisters.\nI can't get it out of my mind.\nI wanted to fight this Yabu,\nbut the wraiths have absorbed all of the energy\nfrom the rift system and grown very strong.\nFather locked me inside the Landspire,\nand said to not let anyone, or anything, inside."
*key = 123
*value = "I can't sleep; all I hear are screams\nand cries outside. The wraiths\nare sucking the life force out of our world.\nThey drain the souls from their victims,\nand keep them in these horrible jars.\nI want to leave the Landspire\nand fight with Father, but he said\nI'm too young, and it's more important that\nI keep the keystaff safely away from the wraiths."
*key = 124
*value = "Through the eyehole, I saw father fighting another\nAstana, but it turned out to be a wraith.\nHe came back later, and told me to bring the\nkeystaff out, but it wasn't really him.\nIt was another wraith trying to trick me.\nIt's so hard to know who to trust when\nthese things can change their shape like this."
*key = 125
*value = "The screams have stopped; it's so quiet now.\nI disobeyed father, and went outside.\nOur world is torn to bits,\nand pieces of it are scattered across the sky.\nMy nightmares were true. Father is dead."
*key = 126
*value = "I found him clutching a spire of rock,\nthe talons imbedded in it;\nI guess he wanted to keep the War Talons\nfrom the wraiths at the end.\nAt least all of the wraiths seem to be gone;\ngrotesque beating hearts\nare all that remain of them."
*key = 127
*value = "Dark Yabu is alive! He's built a fortress\nin the far reaches of Astara's ruins.\nIn some twisted way, his citadel actually\nlives and has sucked the energy out\nof the world around it like a parasite.\nThe land nearby has become even more\ndesolate and cold than it already was."
*key = 128
*value = "Strangely, the thought of Yabu\nliving consoles me. Perhaps if he survived,\nsome of my own people may live yet somewhere.\nI now have a quest. I will show Yabu\nthe same mercy he showed my family."
*key = 129
*value = "I have visited what remains of Astara.\nMy people are gone. I'm the last one.\nThe life that once lived here\nhas become dark and twisted.\nThose vile Wraithhearts still beat with life."
*key = 130
*value = "The wraiths sucked the energy\nout of the Rift Gate System\nand it seems to live on in these wicked vessels.\nThe portal gates still stand\nand the system can be recharged;\nthe main portal could be opened again.\nI can never let this happen."
*key = 131
*value = "A new civilization grows amongst\nthe treetops in a corner of\nAstara they call the Overwood.\nAs I studied their simple culture,\nI found myself moved by the respect with which"
*key = 132
*value = "they regard their world and each other.\nI thought of my people and how\nfoolish and prideful we were.\nThese people are content with their peaceful lives.\nI hope that peace remains."
*key = 133
*value = "Something terrible is coming.\nAfter all this time, Dark Yabu is\nmoving about Astara, searching.\nHe seems to have collected an army\nof beasts from the Shadowrealm.\nI fear he is trying to collect\nthe Wraithhearts to re-open the gate\nand bring back his fellow Wraiths."
*key = 134
*value = "But, I discovered that, for some reason,\nYabu cannot touch the hearts,\nor even get close to them.\nI've hidden as many of them as I can,\nalthough I can't find some of them myself.\nPerhaps Yabu is searching for someone to\ncomplete this gruesome collection for him."
*key = 135
*value = "My worst fears are realized.\nYabu has discovered the people of Overwood\nand is heading towards them.\nDoes he mean to make them perform his\ncursed errand and collect the hearts?"
*key = 136
*value = "I fear there is nothing I can do\nto help the peaceful people.\nTheir guardian, Vargas, is old\nand no match for Yabu and his creatures.\nI hope there is one among them\nthat can stand up to Yabu's wickedness,\nbut I fear the worst."
*key = 137
*value = "Now for combat. Press <4>, <4>, <4>, to do a 3-Hit Slash Combo."
*key = 138
*value = "Good. You can do an UPPERCUT by holding down the <9> button, and then pressing the <4> button.<pause>This attack can be used against airborne enemies."
*key = 139
*value = "To do a GROUNDBLAST, first JUMP into the air by pressing the <3> button,<pause>and then press the <9> button while you are in the air."
*key = 140
*value = "You can also perform a FLARE KICK by pressing the <4> button while in the air."
*key = 141
*value = "We have waited an eternity for one who perceives with the mind and not the eye."
*key = 142
*value = "The mark of your Grandfather Vargas' passing lies heavily upon you.  A part of you is linked to him even in death..."
*key = 143
*value = "As Yabu murdered Vargas he deemed your Grandfather unfit for the mercy of eternal peace.\nYet, he imprisoned that part of him which could never be held captive in life.\nYour Grandfather's essence is trapped in the realm of Dark Yabu's amulet, \nwhere Yabu will feed upon his constant pain and fear until Vargas is no more."
*key = 144
*value = "But if you learn our ways, the potential to save him is in your hands.  \nWe will grant you the knowledge and experience of all of the Guardians who have borne us throughout the ages.  \nWe can help you to unlock the doors of your own perception so that you may avenge your Grandfather \nand redeem him from his plight."
*key = 145
*value = "You have done well.  Beyond this door lies the world in which you alone must use what you have learned to achieve your purpose."
*key = 146
*value = "Take heart, for the measure of a person lies not in how one deals with the easiest situations,\nbut rather in what you do when faced with the most hopeless of circumstances."
*key = 147
*value = "This is a WRAITHHEART. Each one contains the vital essence of a Shadowraith demon."
*key = 148
*value = "Many of these WRAITHHEARTS have split into 100 smaller pieces called SHARDS."
*key = 149
*value = "If you obtain all 100 SHARDS of a WRAITHHEART, they will come together of their own accord to re-form that WRAITHHEART."
*key = 150
*value = "Very good. Each of the areas throughout Astara contains exactly 100 of these SHARDS."
*key = 151
*value = "These are known as SOUL JARS. The souls of fallen Astani Warriors are imprisoned within these vessels.<pause>If you bring 6 SOUL JARS together, the 6 freed spirits will reward you with the WRAITHHEART of a SHADOWRAITH <pause>slain by the warriors during their time among the living."
*key = 152
*value = "You can look around with the camera by moving the <11> right analog stick.<pause>Try pointing the center of the camera view towards each of the 6 SOUL JARS around you."
*key = 153
*value = "Now try to get all 6 SOUL JARS."
*key = 154
*value = "Great job, Vexx. You can now pick up the WRAITHHEART."
*key = 155
*value = "You can also use your attacks to interact with certain devices such as the SHATTERSPHERES."
*key = 156
*value = "Some of these attacks can also be cancelled into each other by inputting the command for one right after the other.<pause>This will allow you avoid undesirable recovery times on certain moves."
*key = 157
*value = "As you connect your attacks with enemies, you will absorb power from them.<pause>The SUPER METER at the bottom of the screen shows how much power you have gained.<pause>When your meter is completely full it will flash. Try attacking this PUGGLE until your SUPER METER is filled."
*key = 158
*value = "You can then unleash the talons SUPER power in different ways. First press the <10> button to activate SUPER MODE.<pause>Once you are in SUPER MODE you can run faster, and pressing the <4> button will fling fireballs at your enemies."
*key = 159
*value = "You can also expend your full SUPER METER in one move by holding the <9> button,<pause>then pressing the <10> button while still holding the <9> button."
*key = 160
*value = "To unleash your molten fate, a crimson rune's the key.  Where once you lay in state, look in a tapestry."
*key = 161
*value = "Above a long dead thing, on ledge it sits in wait. A rune that gives you wing, to fly you to your fate."
*key = 162
*value = "Certain attacks such as the UPPERCUT and FLARE KICK will launch your opponent high into the air.<pause>This leaves your opponent vulnerable to successive juggle attacks as they are tumbling through the air."
*key = 163
*value = "When you are hit by an enemy, your HEALTH METER displayed on the bottom left of the screen will decrease.<pause>You can obtain items that refill your HEALTH METER by killing or juggling enemies."
*key = 164
*value = "If you fall from a high area, use a FLARE KICK before you hit the ground to avoid taking damage."
*key = 165
*value = "Use the <11> right analog stick to move the camera around Vexx."
*key = 166
*value = "Press the SELECT button at any time to view your WRAITHHEART clues."
*key = 167
*value = "Perform a PULSE JUMP to gain extra height. <pause>When stationary, hold the <9> button to crouch, followed by the <3> button."
*key = 168
*value = "Perform an UPPERCUT ATTACK to send enemies into the air. <pause>When stationary, hold the <9> button to crouch, followed by the <4> button."
*key = 169
*value = "Perform a LONG JUMP to gain extra distance. <pause>While running, press the <9> button to crouch, immediately followed by the <3> button. <pause>Timing is the key!"
*key = 170
*value = "CLIMBING WALLS are engraved with unique markings. <pause>JUMP onto a CLIMBING WALL to start climbing.  <pause>Move UP with the <7> left analog stick and press the <3> button to scale climbing walls quicker. <pause>Release the <3> button to grab onto wall when scaling. <pause>Press the <3> button with no left analog stick direction to jump away from the wall. <pause>Press the <4> button to release from the wall."
*key = 171
*value = "Outscore\nyour inner demons\n3 times to win!"
*key = 172
*value = "Survive 3\nrounds to prevail!"
